OpenArchiver Slim — unofficial fork
===================================

Upstream project: LogicLabs-OU/OpenArchiver
Upstream URL:     https://github.com/LogicLabs-OU/OpenArchiver
Upstream version: v0.6.2
License:          AGPL-3.0 (see LICENSE)

This repository contains modifications by the OpenArchiver Slim fork. The
modifications are licensed under the same AGPL-3.0 terms. They are summarised
in FORK.md and include:

- per-source folder filters and a folder list endpoint,
- a folder picker in the ingestion source form,
- mailbox folder metadata in the search index and a search-page folder filter,
- server-side bulk deletion by folder,
- HTML sanitization and remote-content blocking in the email viewer,
- a GitHub Actions CI and image-publishing workflow.

The upstream copyright notices and the LICENSE file are retained. The source
of every published image is this repository; keep it available when passing the
image or the service on.
